  "Software Details": "Detalles del programa",
  "The Dash Saas Bookings Module makes managing your appointments simple and hassle-free. Our easy-to-use interface lets you set up and adjust booking slots quickly, ensuring your calendar is always up-to-date. Whether you are a solo business owner or managing a team, our scheduling tool adapts to your needs. From one-time meetings to recurring appointments, you’ll stay organized and in control with ease.": "El módulo de reservas de Dash Saas hace que administrar sus citas sea simple y sin complicaciones. ",
  "/Month": "/Mes",
  "/Year": "/Año",
  "Buy Now": "Comprar ahora",
  "View Live Demo": "Ver demostración en vivo",
  "Simplify Your Schedule with Dash SaaS Booking Module": "Simplifique su agenda con el módulo de reservas Dash SaaS",
  "Streamline your scheduling with Dash SaaS Booking. Integrated seamlessly into the Dash Saas platform, our intuitive module minimizes conflicts and enhances customer satisfaction. Simplify appointments effortlessly.": "Optimice su programación con Dash SaaS Booking. ",
  "Great Customer Experience": "Gran experiencia del cliente",
  "Providing a great customer experience is simple with the Dash Saas Bookings Module. Clients can book appointments anytime through an easy online portal. Automatic confirmations and reminders help reduce no-shows, keeping everyone informed and prepared. The seamless integration with your website and social media allows clients to book services without leaving their favorite platforms, making the process smooth and convenient.": "Brindar una excelente experiencia al cliente es simple con el módulo de reservas de Dash Saas. ",
  "Easy Integration and Customization": "Fácil integración y personalización",
  "Our Bookings Module works well with the tools you already use. Easily integrate with popular calendar apps like Google Calendar and Outlook to keep all your schedules in sync. Customize booking forms and workflows to fit your business needs. Whether you need to collect detailed information upfront or offer different service options, our module allows you to create a booking experience that matches your brand.": "Nuestro módulo de reservas funciona bien con las herramientas que ya utiliza. ",
  "Useful Analytics": "Análisis útiles",
  "Get valuable insights into your booking trends and business performance with the Dash Saas Bookings Module/s analytics. Track important metrics like appointment numbers, peak booking times, and customer preferences. Use this data to make better decisions about staffing, marketing, and services. Our simple reports and dashboards give you a clear view of how your booking system is doing, helping you improve efficiency and profitability. Plus, you can manage bookings from both the backend and frontend, giving you complete control and flexibility over your scheduling process.": "Obtenga información valiosa sobre sus tendencias de reservas y el rendimiento empresarial con los análisis del módulo/s de reservas de Dash Saas. ",
  "Online Payments": "Pagos en línea",
  "With the Dash Saas Bookings Module, customers can pay for their appointments online quickly and securely. We support major payment gateways like Stripe and PayPal, making it easy for clients to complete transactions. This feature not only enhances convenience but also ensures that payments are processed efficiently, reducing the risk of missed payments and improving your cash flow. Offering online payment options helps streamline your business operations and provides a seamless experience for your customers.": "Con el módulo de reservas de Dash Saas, los clientes pueden pagar sus citas en línea de forma rápida y segura. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "¿Por qué elegir módulos dedicados?",
